.TH man 1 "2026-11-19" "0.20.0" "Profanity XMPP client"

.SH NAME
/form

.SH DESCRIPTION
Interact with XMPP data forms (XEP-0004) in configuration windows, such as chat room setup or vCard editing. Allows displaying the form, viewing field descriptions, clearing fields, and submitting changes.

.SH SYNOPSIS
/form show

.LP
/form clear <field>

.LP
/form submit

.LP
/form cancel

.LP
/form help [<tag>]

.LP

.SH ARGUMENTS
.PP
\fBshow\fR
.RS 4
Display the current form and its fields.
.RE
.PP
\fBclear <field>\fR
.RS 4
Clear the value of the specified field.
.RE
.PP
\fBsubmit\fR
.RS 4
Submit completed form to the server.
.RE
.PP
\fBcancel\fR
.RS 4
Cancel changes and close the form window.
.RE
.PP
\fBhelp [<tag>]\fR
.RS 4
Display help for the entire form or a specific field tag.
.RE
